      "h": 1088,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "Shadow effect styles express the elevation ladder. Control surfaces sit just off the page; raised, overlay, and dialog progress upward as the surface gains autonomy. Focus and feedback shadows are non-elevational — they reinforce a state on top of an already-elevated surface.\n\nAll shadow color is variable-bound and adapts to mode automatically.",
